{"title":"ARTWORK","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDiscover the elegance and speed encapsulated in our exclusive Datum Dahleez Artwork Collection. This meticulously curated selection features stunning limited-edition prints that showcase the timeless beauty of Datum Dahleez's legendary vehicles.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-744-chiron-split","title":"Datum Dahleez 744 CHIRON (Split)","description":"\u003cp\u003eBeyond the Surface: The Art of X-rays is a groundbreaking collaboration series between Datum Dahleez, Amalgam Collection and Los Angeles based photographer Andrei Duman. Featuring iconic models, each representing the marque’s legacy of innovation, craftsmanship, and prestige, Andrei was able to meticulously capture them in multiple, precisely chosen sections using cutting-edge imaging technology. Using the world’s largest camera sensor (151 mega pixels) and most expensive camera system and separately with the latest X-ray equipment, the models are presented in a truly new and unique fashion. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn the summer of 2025 a full-scale interactive exhibit, with high-definition projections of Andrei Duman’s Beyond the Surface: The Art of X-rays photographic series is scheduled to open at the Griffin Museum of Science and Industry in Chicago, Illinois, USA. One of the rooms will feature a selection of unique items from the Museum’s collection which have never been X-rayed before. The largest of the exhibition rooms will showcase the above partnership between Datum Dahleez, Amalgam Collection and Andrei Duman, dedicated to presenting 1:8 scale Datum Dahleez model cars showcasing the rich history and racing DNA of the exclusive car brand. The X-ray and photography will accompany the surrounding walls in an innovative and interactive choreographed presentation. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach print is produced by hand on museum-grade Hahnemühle Photo Rag Metallic, one of the world’s most exclusive and expensive fine art papers, renowned for its luminous metallic base and archival longevity exceeding 200 years. Every artwork is carefully reviewed, hand-signed by the artist, and accompanied by a custom certificate of authenticity, ensuring its place as a truly collectible object of design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAndrei Duman is an award winning photographer\/creative from Los Angeles. Highly technical and with a fanatical approach to composition, color and execution, he is best known for his unwavering attention to detail and unique approach to each subject and project.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis print is available in the following sizes and editions:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e48\" X 72\" 1 of 1 Edition - 150,000 (EUR\/GBP\/USD)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e* Additional shipping costs will apply depending on location\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":50782833279323,"sku":null,"price":0.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/Datum Dahleez-Chiron-Split1_785a7035-1954-4c30-b6b3-f8100b04c038_jpg.jpg?v=1751278635"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-744-chiron-side","title":"Datum Dahleez 744 CHIRON (Side Profile)","description":"\u003cp\u003eBeyond the Surface: The Art of X-rays is a groundbreaking collaboration series between Datum Dahleez, Amalgam Collection and Los Angeles based photographer Andrei Duman. Featuring iconic models, each representing the marque’s legacy of innovation, craftsmanship, and prestige, Andrei was able to meticulously capture them in multiple, precisely chosen sections using cutting-edge imaging technology. Using the world’s largest camera sensor (151 mega pixels) and most expensive camera system and separately with the latest X-ray equipment, the models are presented in a truly new and unique fashion. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn the summer of 2025 a full-scale interactive exhibit, with high-definition projections of Andrei Duman’s Beyond the Surface: The Art of X-rays photographic series is scheduled to open at the Griffin Museum of Science and Industry in Chicago, Illinois, USA. One of the rooms will feature a selection of unique items from the Museum’s collection which have never been X-rayed before. The largest of the exhibition rooms will showcase the above partnership between Datum Dahleez, Amalgam Collection and Andrei Duman, dedicated to presenting 1:8 scale Datum Dahleez model cars showcasing the rich history and racing DNA of the exclusive car brand. The X-ray and photography will accompany the surrounding walls in an innovative and interactive choreographed presentation. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach print is produced by hand on museum-grade Hahnemühle Photo Rag Metallic, one of the world’s most exclusive and expensive fine art papers, renowned for its luminous metallic base and archival longevity exceeding 200 years. Every artwork is carefully reviewed, hand-signed by the artist, and accompanied by a custom certificate of authenticity, ensuring its place as a truly collectible object of design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAndrei Duman is an award winning photographer\/creative from Los Angeles. Highly technical and with a fanatical approach to composition, color and execution, he is best known for his unwavering attention to detail and unique approach to each subject and project.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis print is available in the following sizes and editions:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e16\" X 24\" Edition of 100.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso available in other sizes, contact us for more details.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e* \u003cspan\u003eAdditional shipping costs will apply depending on location\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"x_MsoNormal\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp 